    "preamble": "Sanjay Singh vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Deptt. Of ... on 28 July, 2025 Author: Manish Mathur Bench: Manish Mathur High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2025:Ahc-Lko:43306 Court No. - 18 Case :- Writ - A No. - 8227 of 2025 Petitioner :- Sanjay Singh Respondent :- State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Deptt. Of Food Safety And Drug Administrat Counsel for Petitioner :- Mahendra Pratap Singh Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Manish Mathur,J. 1. Heard learned counsel for petitioner and learned State Counsel for opposite parties. 2. Petition has been filed seeking the following prayers:- \"i. issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of Mandamus commanding the opposite parties to verify service of the petitioner during the posting of the petitioner at District Hamirpur and to pay him salary for the period i.e. for 67 days from January 2022 to May 2022, salary of the petitioner from the month of May 2023 to the month of June 2023, salary of the petitioner from the Month of July 2023 to Sanjay Singh vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Deptt. Of ... on 28 July, 2025",
    "facts": "It is submitted that with regard to aforesaid reliefs, theCommissioner, Food Safety and Drug Administration, Government of U.P., Lucknow has already issued directions dated 12.04.2025, which are not being complied with.",
